{"id":"5d15fa98a4af2340","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-cut-rule.md","title":"双边切规则实例","display":"df-cut-rule — 双边切规则实例","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-cut-rule","aliases":["18-df-cut-rule","18-df-033"],"display":"df-cut-rule — 双边切规则实例","depends_on":["[[18-df-sequent]]"],"verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-cut-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-cut-rule</span><span>18-df-033</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cut-rule — 双边切规则实例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"914b63100f991c01\" href=\"?note=914b63100f991c01\" title=\"18-df-sequent\">18-df-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q,s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\">\\(p,q,s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，均按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"914b63100f991c01\" href=\"?note=914b63100f991c01\" title=\"18-df-sequent\">18-df-sequent</a>。</p>\n<p>本节引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cut}:\\mathrm{Seq}_S^3\\to\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cut}:\\mathrm{Seq}_S^3\\to\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Cut}(p,q;s)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{&lt;\\omega}\\,\n\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\,\\bigl(&amp;p=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land q=\\langle\\Pi\\cup\\{A\\},\\Lambda\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land s=\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\Pi,\\Delta\\cup\\Lambda\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Cut}(p,q;s)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{&lt;\\omega}\\,\n\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\,\\bigl(&amp;p=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land q=\\langle\\Pi\\cup\\{A\\},\\Lambda\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land s=\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\Pi,\\Delta\\cup\\Lambda\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧稿只展示一个肯定的规则实例，未定义谓词的外延；现在用双条件完整给出该关系。原书 §4.5 和 §7.3 使用单边的对偶公式切规则；两种接口有标准翻译，但这里不混淆它们。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"914b63100f991c01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"914b63100f991c01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p,q,s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S$，$\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{<\\omega}$，$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，均按 [[18-df-sequent]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,q,s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cut}:\\mathrm{Seq}_S^3\\to\\{\\bot,\\top\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Cut}(p,q;s)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]^{<\\omega}\\,\n\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\,\\bigl(&p=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\}\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land q=\\langle\\Pi\\cup\\{A\\},\\Lambda\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land s=\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\Pi,\\Delta\\cup\\Lambda\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1136,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-cut-rule]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-cut-rule]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-cut-rule]]"}],"outgoing":["914b63100f991c01"]}